msgid "如果 IRModule 包含任何 Python 函数，会使用 JIT 编译延迟 TIR 和 Relax 函数的编译。这意味着："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/frontend/relax/RelaxPythonModuleDesign/intro.ipynb:80006
msgid "TVMScript 解析时不会编译 TIR 和 Relax 函数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/frontend/relax/RelaxPythonModuleDesign/intro.ipynb:80007
msgid "编译仅在实例化 IRModule 时发生，此时："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/frontend/relax/RelaxPythonModuleDesign/intro.ipynb:80008
msgid "TIR 函数会被编译并存储在实例化的模块中。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/frontend/relax/RelaxPythonModuleDesign/intro.ipynb:80009
msgid "会创建 Relax 虚拟机来执行编译后的 Relax 函数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/frontend/relax/RelaxPythonModuleDesign/intro.ipynb:90002
msgid "这种 JIT 策略允许更灵活的后期修改和与 Python 运行时的集成。"
msgstr ""

